## Key Configuration Details

### Tailwind Custom Theme
- **Fonts:** poppins, pt-serif, fira-code, montserrat, opensans
- **Colors:** green (#64ffda), blue (#3CB1E4), dark (#222222), darker (#141414), light (#fafafa), muted (#a8b2d1)
- **Spacing:** nav (11.5rem), 480px, 600px

### Environment Variables (in .env.development / .env.production)
- `SANITY_PROJECT_ID` — Sanity project ID
- `SANITY_DATASET` — Sanity dataset name
- `SANITY_TOKEN` — Sanity API token
- Accessed via `$env/static/private` in SvelteKit

### Data Fetching
- All data fetched server-side via **GROQ queries** in `+page.server.ts` load functions
- Sanity client configured in `src/lib/sanity.ts`
- Block content rendered with @portabletext/svelte
- Images served via @sanity/image-url builder

### Interactive Effects
- **Vanta.js Birds** animation on hero section (requires Three.js)
- Three.js loaded via script tag in `app.html`
- Hover transitions on project images (brightness, grayscale)
- Blink cursor animation on error page

### Font Libraries (@fontsource)
- @fontsource/poppins (primary headings, weight 700)
- @fontsource/pt-serif (body/accent)
- @fontsource/fira-code (code blocks)
- @fontsource/montserrat (resume)
- @fontsource/open-sans (resume)
